    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="pivot">Host in the OOB form's right accessories column as a PCF — do NOT build/replace the form with a Code Page (W4 pivot; ADR-026 Path-A exception in spec.md).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">PCF platform-library React/Fluent per ADR-022; PCF lifecycle (init/updateView/destroy); read record via control context (no self-bootstrapped MSAL; host context supplies auth).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">Reuse the regarding family — `PolymorphicResolverService.applyResolverFields` + `TODO_REGARDING_CATALOG`. Write typed regarding lookups + denormalized fields. MUST NOT add a new regarding mechanism (§11).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Port the converged prototype ConnectionsEditor — do NOT redesign the UX. Multi-slot per-entity, per-slot confidence band + confirm, Accept-all, Link-another, create-from-email (engine-suggested flagged).</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-07">Review + "Communications Awaiting Association" view are matter-level auth-scoped (ADR-003/008); AI privilege flagged, never decided (ADR-015).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Override reasons persisted as a feedback SIGNAL only — no learning loop (out of scope).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">View filter uses task-002-verified option-set integers for Suggested/Ambiguous (do NOT hardcode unverified integers).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Build the PCF with `npm run build:prod` (NOT `npm run build`); deploy per `pcf-deploy` conventions.</constraint>
  </constraints>

