  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read the prototype `ConnectionsEditor.tsx` + `provenance.ts` (the converged design) and `RegardingResolver/` (PCF + Fluent-v9-in-PCF + regarding write). Confirm `PolymorphicResolverService.applyResolverFields` signature.</step>
    <step order="2">Scaffold the PCF (`src/client/pcf/CommunicationConnections/` or per pcf conventions): manifest binding the control to the `sprk_communication` form; platform-library React/Fluent (ADR-022); React root + FluentProvider.</step>
    <step order="3">Port the ConnectionsEditor + provenance helpers into the PCF React tree. Source the record's `sprk_associationprovenance` + `sprk_associationstatus` + regarding fields from `context` (parameters/webAPI), not a URL.</step>
    <step order="4">Wire per-slot Confirm / Accept-all → `PolymorphicResolverService.applyResolverFields` for the chosen target(s); set `sprk_associationstatus` → Resolved when all review slots resolved. Handle ambiguous slots (pick one). Optional Field Mapping on accept via `FieldMappingService`.</step>
    <step order="5">Wire "Link another record…" (regarding catalog picker) + override-reason capture (feedback signal field/note; no learning loop).</step>
    <step order="6">Wire "create from this email" actions (Event / To Do / Invoice); engine-suggested ones flagged from provenance signals. For R4, these may stub the create flow / navigate to a create form (full create-and-link wiring may defer to W5) — do NOT re-implement association logic client-side.</step>
    <step order="7">Author the "Communications Awaiting Association" Dataverse view (`sprk_associationstatus in (Suggested, Pending Review, Ambiguous)`, matter-level auth-scoped; privilege flag column, never auto-decide).</step>
    <step order="8">`npm run build:prod` the PCF — clean single bundle.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor gates: `code-review` on the diff; `adr-check` against `spec.md` (ADR-022/024/015/003/008 + §11 reuse + ADR-026 Path-A pivot). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (042 ✅) + `current-task.md`; record catalog-extension decisions + feedback-signal storage. Deploy is task 043.</step>
  </steps>

